	(text "All serial connectors: 1 = 5V_PERIPH, 2 = flight-controller TX, 3 = flight-controller RX, 4 = GND.\nConnect TX to peripheral RX and RX to peripheral TX. No RS-232 levels and no 5V logic.\n5V_PERIPH is MAIN-powered only and limited to ~0.5A total across all six ports. Use separate power for larger loads.\nUSART6 is reserved by convention for a serial receiver (CRSF / SBUS with MCU inversion configured).\nNo RTS/CTS, external inverter or PPM input is fitted. Prevent powered peripherals back-feeding an unpowered board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 225 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9df68fbc-49c3-5a3f-a4ee-dc708dc0d09a")
	)
